s5-art 2026-11-26: mask.png (SCP-035 piece, 512 px, centred at 90%). The old 256 px crop had the hat top and the ear sides cut by the video's square. The mask is the creator's own art from iwantcheckmate.com (Containment Breach engine.js -> https://iwantcheckmate.com/challenges/containment-breach/assets/mask.png, 1536 px, transparent); in this video it sits on a white bust (round ears, shoulders, white behind the mouth), which is re-traced crisp from the video sprite research/frames/sprites/4XV3SBMQgXE_scp035.png and placed under the site mask at the video's scale/offset (IoU search). Tool: tools/art_s5_mask.py.
